{"seq":2,"slug":"vit-finetuning","title":"微调与迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/vision-transformers-architectures/practice/vit-finetuning","wordCount":1284,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"微调与迁移\">微调与迁移</h1><p><a href=\"vit-pretraining\">预训练 (MAE/DINO)</a> 解决了「从哪来一个会看图的 ViT」，这一篇解决「怎么把它盘活到自己的任务上」。手里有一份在 17 亿图上自监督预训练的骨干，下游只有几千到几万张标注图，怎么微调既不浪费这份表示、又不在小数据上过拟合？答案取决于你的数据量、算力和任务，下面把几条路线和 ViT 特有的坑讲清。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-按预算选迁移强度\">核心概念：按预算选迁移强度</h2><p>把预训练骨干盘活到下游，本质是在「改多少」上做选择：从全参微调（全改、上限最高、最贵）到线性探测（几乎不改、最省），中间是参数高效微调（只插少量参数）。选哪条取决于数据量与算力，而 ViT 还有一个绕不过的特有坑——换分辨率要插值位置编码。下面先铺开三条路线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三条迁移路线-全参-线性探测-参数高效\">三条迁移路线：全参、线性探测、参数高效</h2><p>预训练骨干的用法是一个谱系，从「全改」到「几乎不改」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>路线</th>\n<th>改动范围</th>\n<th>数据需求</th>\n<th>算力</th>\n<th>典型表现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全参微调 (full fine-tune)</td>\n<td>整个骨干 + 头</td>\n<td>中到大</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>上限最高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线性探测 (linear probe)</td>\n<td>仅一个线性头，冻结骨干</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>衡量表示质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参数高效 (LoRA/Adapter)</td>\n<td>注入少量可训练参数</td>\n<td>小到中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>接近全参，省存储</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>全参微调</strong>把整个 ViT 连同新分类头一起训，上限最高，但在小数据上容易过拟合且算力贵。<strong>线性探测</strong>冻结骨干、只训一个线性分类头，几乎不耗算力，常被用作「衡量预训练表示有多好」的标尺——这正是 <a href=\"vit-pretraining\">预训练 (MAE/DINO)</a> 里说 DINO 线性探测强、MAE 线性探测弱的评测含义。<strong>参数高效微调</strong>是 2026 年小数据场景的甜点：冻结绝大部分骨干，只插入少量可训练参数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"参数高效微调-lora-与适配器\">参数高效微调：LoRA 与适配器</h2><p>LoRA（Low-Rank Adaptation）的思路是不直接改权重矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>，而是在旁边并联一个低秩增量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta W = BA</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\in \\mathbb{R}^{r \\times d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B \\in \\mathbb{R}^{d \\times r}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，秩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>≪</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r \\ll d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>。前向变成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>W</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h = Wx + BAx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>，训练时只更新 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A, B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 冻结。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class LoRALinear(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, base: nn.Linear, r=8, alpha=16):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.base = base                       # 冻结的原始权重&#10;        for p in self.base.parameters():&#10;            p.requires_grad = False&#10;        d_out, d_in = base.weight.shape&#10;        self.A = nn.Parameter(torch.randn(r, d_in) * 0.01)&#10;        self.B = nn.Parameter(torch.zeros(d_out, r))   # 零初始化: 起步等于原模型&#10;        self.s = alpha / r&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        return self.base(x) + self.s * (x @ self.A.T) @ self.B.T\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LoRALinear</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, base: nn.Linear, r</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base                       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 冻结的原始权重</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.base.parameters():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            p.requires_grad </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> False</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        d_out, d_in </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base.weight.shape</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.A </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Parameter(torch.randn(r, d_in) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.B </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Parameter(torch.zeros(d_out, r))   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 零初始化: 起步等于原模型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.base(x) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.A.T) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.B.T</span></span></code></pre></div><p>由于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 零初始化，训练起点恰好等于原模型，稳定且不破坏预训练知识。可训练参数常只占全模型的 1% 以下，却能逼近全参微调的精度，还能为多个下游任务各存一份小小的 LoRA 权重而共享同一份骨干。LoRA 的通用机制属于 <a href=\"../../llm-fine-tuning/\">LLM 微调</a> 的范畴，这里只取它在 ViT 上的用法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"vit-微调特有的坑-位置编码插值\">ViT 微调特有的坑：位置编码插值</h2><p>把这个坑单独拎出来，因为它是 ViT 迁移里最容易翻车又最隐蔽的地方。预训练常在 224×224 做，下游为了精度往往想用更高分辨率（如 384×384）。可 <a href=\"../architecture/positional-encoding-2d\">二维位置编码</a> 讲过，原版 ViT 的可学习位置向量是按 14×14 网格学的，换到 24×24 网格就对不上号——必须把位置向量 reshape 回二维、双三次插值放大、再拉平，否则模型直接乱套。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[加载预训练骨干&lt;br/&gt;224 分辨率 14x14 位置] --&gt; B{下游用更高分辨率?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| C[直接微调]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| D[位置编码 reshape 回 14x14]&#10;  D --&gt; E[双三次插值到目标网格]&#10;  E --&gt; F[替换位置表后再微调]&#10;  C --&gt; G[选路线: 全参/线性探测/LoRA]&#10;  F --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  A[加载预训练骨干&lt;br/&gt;224 分辨率 14x14 位置] --&gt; B{下游用更高分辨率?}\n  B --&gt;|否| C[直接微调]\n  B --&gt;|是| D[位置编码 reshape 回 14x14]\n  D --&gt; E[双三次插值到目标网格]\n  E --&gt; F[替换位置表后再微调]\n  C --&gt; G[选路线: 全参/线性探测/LoRA]\n  F --&gt; G</pre><p>忘记这一步是新手最常见的「微调后精度暴跌」原因。用 RoPE 位置编码的现代模型（如 DINOv3）天生免疫这个问题，这也是它换 RoPE 的实际收益之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一套实操决策\">一套实操决策</h2><p>把上面收成可执行的判断。数据极少（千级）且只想快速基线：线性探测，几分钟出结果，也顺便判断这份预训练表示对你的任务够不够好。数据中等（万级）、算力有限、或要服务多个任务：LoRA/适配器，省算力省存储、过拟合风险低。数据较多、追求极限精度、算力充足：全参微调，但配好学习率分层（骨干小、新头大）和强数据增广。任何情况下，若改了输入分辨率，先处理好位置编码插值再谈别的。任务若是检测分割这类密集预测，参照 <a href=\"../architecture/cls-token-pooling\">类别 token 与池化</a> 保留 patch token、接合适的颈部，下游头的设计属于 <a href=\"../../computer-vision/\">计算机视觉</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>迁移路线是个谱系：全参微调上限最高但贵且易过拟合；线性探测极省、用作表示质量标尺；参数高效（LoRA/适配器）是小数据甜点。</li>\n<li>LoRA 用低秩并联增量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta W = BA</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 零初始化保证起步等于原模型，常以 &lt;1% 参数逼近全参精度并支持多任务共享骨干。</li>\n<li>ViT 特有坑：换分辨率必须对位置编码做二维插值，否则精度暴跌；RoPE 模型天生免疫。</li>\n<li>决策按数据量与算力选路线，改分辨率先修位置编码，密集预测保留 patch token。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>预训练表示从何而来、线性探测的评测含义：<a href=\"vit-pretraining\">预训练 (MAE/DINO)</a></li>\n<li>位置编码插值的机理：<a href=\"../architecture/positional-encoding-2d\">二维位置编码</a></li>\n<li>密集预测要保留的 patch 表示：<a href=\"../architecture/cls-token-pooling\">类别 token 与池化</a></li>\n<li>LoRA 的通用机制（跨 hub）：<a href=\"../../llm-fine-tuning/\">LLM 微调 · 参数高效微调</a></li>\n<li>视觉迁移学习实践（跨 hub）：<a href=\"../../computer-vision/image-classification/transfer-learning-cv\">计算机视觉 · 迁移学习</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"微调与迁移","id":"微调与迁移"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：按预算选迁移强度","id":"核心概念-按预算选迁移强度"},{"level":2,"text":"三条迁移路线：全参、线性探测、参数高效","id":"三条迁移路线-全参-线性探测-参数高效"},{"level":2,"text":"参数高效微调：LoRA 与适配器","id":"参数高效微调-lora-与适配器"},{"level":2,"text":"ViT 微调特有的坑：位置编码插值","id":"vit-微调特有的坑-位置编码插值"},{"level":2,"text":"一套实操决策","id":"一套实操决策"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"预训练 (MAE/DINO)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/vision-transformers-architectures/practice/vit-pretraining"},"next":{"title":"部署与边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/vision-transformers-architectures/practice/vit-deployment"}}